                            Bulletin Menu Help
                            ------------------


From the Bulletin Menu you can read a variety of text files placed there by
the Sysop.  To see which text files are available for reading, hit '?' and
you will see that each file has a corresponding number.  Hit that number and
you will be able to view that file.

You can also hit 'G' for Good-bye, and 'Q' to Quit to the Main Menu.

